      "id": "arles-canvas-scene",
      "type": "scene",
      "title": {
        "zhHans": "完成画布",
        "en": "Completing the Canvas"
      },
      "subtitle": {
        "zhHans": "颜色开始变成通往另一层空间的钥匙",
        "en": "Color becomes a key to another layer"
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "minor",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "structural-label",
        "sourceIds": [
          "editorial-rla"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "arles-canvas-p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "随着画作碎片、调色材料和房间里的颜色线索逐渐汇合，卧室从“被艺术包围”转变成“可以被艺术重新组织”的空间。玩家不是单纯找到钥匙，而是在把散落的视觉信息重新拼成完整画面。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "As picture fragments, painting materials, and color clues converge, the bedroom changes from a room surrounded by art into a room that can be reorganized through art. Progress comes from rebuilding scattered visual information into completed images."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "minor",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "editorial-summary",
        "sourceIds": [
          "primary-arles-game",
          "editorial-rla"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "arles-canvas-p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "其中一幅未完成的画在颜色被补全后显出一个 "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "concept",
              "id": "black-cube"
            },
            "label": "黑色方块"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "。方块因此不只是被“找到”的物件，而像是从图像内部被提取出来。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "One unfinished image reveals a "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "concept",
              "id": "black-cube"
            },
            "label": "Black Cube"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " once its colors are completed. The cube is not merely found in the room; it seems to be extracted from the image itself."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "major",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "editorial-summary",
        "sourceIds": [
          "primary-arles-game"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "arles-canvas-p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "这一段把本作最重要的视觉规则建立起来：现实房间、画布和后续的超现实空间之间没有稳定边界，艺术作品会直接改变可行动的世界。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "This establishes Arles' central visual rule: the bedroom, the canvas, and the later impossible spaces do not have stable boundaries. An artwork can directly alter the world the player can act within."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "minor",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "editorial-summary",
        "sourceIds": [
          "primary-arles-game",
          "editorial-rla"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "arles-canvas-black",
      "type": "interaction",
      "action": "open-entity",
